Apollo Theme palette lineage

Apollo Theme adapts Gruvbox Dark Hard, originally created by Pavel Pertsev and
released under the MIT License. Its terminal mapping and near-black canvas are
based on the Modified Gruvbox Dark Hard theme shipped by SonicTerm.

Gruvbox: https://github.com/morhetz/gruvbox
SonicTerm source: https://github.com/D0n9X1n/SonicTerm/blob/main/assets/themes/wezterm.toml

The name "Apollo Theme" in this project does not refer to the unrelated
46-color pixel-art palette also named Apollo.
